   "title": "Food",
   "text": [
    "Soup joumou, a pumpkin soup once forbidden to enslaved people, is eaten on Independence Day and is on UNESCO's list. Griot (fried pork) and pikliz (spicy slaw) are favourites."
   ]
  }
